; Program 3.16: Factorial n! for any n >= 0, including 0
; Source: Дьяконов, «Справочник по расчётам на микрокалькуляторах», 1985, p.61 (book61.pdf page 62)
; Input: n in X.  Output: n! in X.  С/П again with a new n (the program loops to 00).
;
; Book examples: 0! = 1, 1! = 1, 3! = 6, 10! = 3628800, 20! = 2,432902*10^18
; @input 0
; @expect X=1
; @input 1
; @expect X=1
; @input 3
; @expect X=6
; @input 10
; @expect X=3628800
; @input 20
; @expect X=2.432902e18
;
; MK56-ASM form of 03-16-factorial-any.mk56, generated by mk56asm -s.
; Each comment gives the address, the keys as printed and the codes.

L00:
        STO R0          ; 00  П0             40
        JZ L11          ; 01  Fx≠0 11        57 11
        1               ; 03  1              01

L04:
        RCL R0          ; 04  ИП0            60
        MUL             ; 05  ×              12
        LOOP0 L04       ; 06  FL0 04         5D 04

L08:
        HALT            ; 08  С/П            50
        JMP L00         ; 09  БП 00          51 00

L11:
        1               ; 11  1              01
        JMP L08         ; 12  БП 08          51 08
